				"description": "{H7 Memorial Shrine}\n\nA shrine in memory of H7, guarded by a full army of level 1-7 creatures from one H7 faction (one stack of each of the two Champions). After defeating the guards, a hero whose army contains upgraded level 1-7 creatures of one H7 faction (one stack per level; either Champion upgrade at level 7) can permanently master that faction's ultimate skill here. Each player can do this only once.\n\nHaven: {Victorious Streak} — During extra actions gained from high Morale, troops deal +50% damage.\nAcademy: {Magic Amplification} — The hero's spell effects (damage, healing) +1% × hero level.\nNecropolis: {Eternal Servitude} — After each attack, if the stack is not wiped out, Bone Soldiers and Skeleton Hoplites (and the original Skeletons and Skeleton Warriors) raise 40% of the stack's dead.\nDungeon: {Coordination} — If a troop's first melee attack each round is not retaliated against, it immediately attacks the same target again for free (once per round).\nStronghold: {Father Sky's Fury} — H7 Memorial Blood Rage (native to H7 Stronghold creatures): +2 Blood Rage at the start of combat; +2 Blood Rage whenever any stack on the battlefield is wiped out.\nSylvan: {Nature's Luck} — Each of your attacks on an enemy stack that your side has already attacked at least 2 times (from the 3rd on) is always a lucky strike (+100% damage, no Luck roll).\nFortress: {Rune of Scattering} — When your side makes a melee attack on an enemy inside your H7 Rune Stone aura, 50% of that damage is also split evenly among all other enemies inside your Rune Stone auras.",
